# Laid out Medium on an opened fold's inner screen (MBUI_WIN=690x840 MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=2): the page brought over, its
# composer one line, then three: in the page panel's corners it follows the panel's corner (InnerOr), whatever it is.
system {"size_class":{"width":"medium","height":"medium"}}
timeout 20000
until 新建对话
wait 600
tapxy -24 420
wait 900
tap 发消息
wait 300
type 第一行
enter
type 第二行
enter
type 第三行
wait 600
exit
